##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene A lock of 64 brown hairs, each two cubic Bezier segments, hanging before a grey wall under a key light, a light behind it and a dim dome
version 3.03
Format 96 64 1
PixelSamples 6 6
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 3
WorldBegin
Light "PxrDomeLight" "sky" "float intensity" [0.1]
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "intensity" [2] "from" [0 0 0] "to" [0.6 -0.5 1]
# a rect light shines along +z unless turned, so the one behind is turned to face the camera and
# tipped down at the lock
TransformBegin
Translate 0 1.2 0.8
Rotate 180 0 1 0
Rotate -30 1 0 0
Light "PxrRectLight" "behind" "float intensity" [3]
TransformEnd
